From cab8d61a1456054282bf5469c452e2be8a7ee739 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GCSA-aegis <aegis@gcsa.local>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 17:03:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Aegis: fix startup DCHECKs and run policy worker in
 chrome://aegis

Skip gin V8 init in the browser process (no snapshot_blob.bin) and
evaluate packages/core in the WebUI renderer instead. Move filter-list
disk IO off the UI thread and cap EasyList downloads at 5 MiB.
